              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embela bantu bako amusako wako, imbelele zyacaabilo cako zikede azilike musokwe mukati ka-Karameli, Ziembelwe mu-Basana amu-Gileadi mbubonya mbuli mumazuba aakamana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoomutondezya zintu zigambya mbubonya mbuli mumazuba alya nowakazwa mu-Egepita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamasi nibayoobona bayoofwa bweeme aanguzu zyabo. Bayoobika maanza amiloma yabo, amatwi aabo ayoosinkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayoomyankuta ivu mbuli inzoka. Bayooza bukalaba akukankama kuzwa kumayubilo aabo mbuli tuuka twaansi. Bayooza buyoowa Jehova Leza wesu. Bayookankama nkaambo kanduwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
